@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/memberships
@contentType = application/json

# Ajustar estos valores a registros reales de tu base de datos.
@existingMembershipId = 4
@nonExistingMembershipId = 999999
@memberId = 4
@membershipPlanId = 1

### 1. Obtener todas las membresías OK
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Obtener una membresía por ID válido OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{existingMembershipId}}

### 3. Obtener una membresía con ID inválido (no numérico) OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc

### 4. Obtener una membresía inexistente  OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{nonExistingMembershipId}}

### 5. Crear una membresía válida OK
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "memberId": "{{memberId}}",
  "membershipPlanId": "{{membershipPlanId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "lastPaymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "lastPaymentDate": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "lastPaymentAmount": 15000
}

### 6. Crear una membresía inválida (memberId no numérico) OK
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "memberId": "abc",
  "membershipPlanId": "{{membershipPlanId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 7. Crear una membresía inválida (fecha inválida) OK
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "memberId": "{{memberId}}",
  "membershipPlanId": "{{membershipPlanId}}",
  "startDate": "fecha-invalida",
  "endDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 8. Crear una membresía inválida (monto de pago negativo) OK
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "memberId": "{{memberId}}",
  "membershipPlanId": "{{membershipPlanId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "lastPaymentAmount": -100
}

### 9. Actualizar una membresía existente con datos válidos OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{existingMembershipId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "lastPaymentMethod": "TRANSFER",
  "lastPaymentDate": "2026-07-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "lastPaymentAmount": 20000
}

### 10. Actualizar una membresía con ID inválido OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/abc
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "lastPaymentAmount": 25000
}

### 11. Actualizar una membresía inexistente OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{nonExistingMembershipId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "lastPaymentMethod": "CASH"
}

### 12. Eliminar una membresía existente  OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{existingMembershipId}}

### 13. Eliminar una membresía con ID inválido  OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/abc

### 14. Eliminar una membresía inexistente  OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{nonExistingMembershipId}}
